   "tag": "p",
   "text": "1 SAMUEL 7:12ECHOED IN STANZA III"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "12Afterward, Samuel took a stone and set it up between Mizpah and Shen. He named it Ebenezer, saying, “Thus far the LORD has helped us.”"
  },
